"2390" y="1159"/><mxPoint x="2390" y="332"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="title" value="Relational schema - Local Farm &amp; Market Food Availability System" style="text;html=1;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1F3D2B;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="45" width="1800" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="panel" value="&lt;b&gt;Important constraints (CHECK constraints and triggers)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ck_units_category (units): (category in (&amp;#x27;mass&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;count&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;ck_units_factor (units): (to_base_factor &amp;gt; 0)&lt;br&gt;ck_crops_category (crops): (category in (&amp;#x27;vegetable&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;fruit&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;leafy&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;herb&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;ck_users_role (users): (role in (&amp;#x27;farmer&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;buyer&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;admin&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;ck_users_failed (users): (failed_attempts &amp;gt;= 0)&lt;br&gt;ck_users_market_role (users): (((role = &amp;#x27;buyer&amp;#x27;) and (market_id is not null)) or ((role &amp;lt;&amp;gt; &amp;#x27;buyer&amp;#x27;) and (market_id is null)))&lt;br&gt;ck_farms_emirate (farms): (emirate in (&amp;#x27;Abu Dhabi&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Dubai&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Sharjah&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Ajman&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Umm Al Quwain&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Ras Al Khaimah&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Fujairah&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;ck_farms_area (farms): ((area_hectares is null) or (area_hectares &amp;gt; 0))&lt;br&gt;ck_markets_emirate (markets): (emirate in (&amp;#x27;Abu Dhabi&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Dubai&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Sharjah&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Ajman&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Umm Al Quwain&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Ras Al Khaimah&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;Fujairah&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;ck_lot_qty (harvest_lots): (quantity &amp;gt; 0)&lt;br&gt;ck_lot_sellby (harvest_lots): ((sell_by_date is null) or (sell_by_date &amp;gt;= harvest_date))&lt;br&gt;ck_cycle_qty (crop_cycles): (expected_quantity &amp;gt;= 0)&lt;br&gt;ck_cycle_dates (crop_cycles): (expected_harvest_date &amp;gt;= planting_date)&lt;br&gt;ck_cycle_status (crop_cycles): (status in (&amp;#x27;PLANNED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;GROWING&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;HARVESTING&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;COMPLETED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;CANCELLED&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;ck_image_mime (harvest_lot_images): (mime_type in (&amp;#x27;image/jpeg&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;image/png&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;ck_req_qty (market_requests): (quantity &amp;gt; 0)&lt;br&gt;ck_req_status (market_requests): (status in (&amp;#x27;SUBMITTED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;ALLOCATED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;PARTIALLY_FULFILLED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;FULFILLED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;CLOSED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;CANCELLED&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;ck_move_qty (stock_movements): (quantity &amp;gt; 0)&lt;br&gt;ck_move_type (stock_movements): (movement_type in (&amp;#x27;HARVEST_ADDED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;RESERVED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;RESERVATION_RELEASED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;DELIVERY&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;LOSS&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;CORRECTION_ADD&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;CORRECTION_REMOVE&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;ck_move_reason (stock_movements): ((movement_type not in (&amp;#x27;LOSS&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;CORRECTION_ADD&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;CORRECTION_REMOVE&amp;#x27;)) or (char_length(trim(coalesce(reason,&amp;#x27;&amp;#x27;))) &amp;gt; 0))&lt;br&gt;ck_alloc_qty (allocations): (quantity &amp;gt; 0)&lt;br&gt;ck_alloc_status (allocations): (status in (&amp;#x27;ACTIVE&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;DELIVERED&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;RELEASED&amp;#x27;))&lt;br&gt;ck_rec_alloc (delivery_receipts): (allocated_quantity &amp;gt; 0)&lt;br&gt;ck_rec_recv (delivery_receipts): (received_quantity &amp;gt;= 0)&lt;br&gt;ck_rec_diff (delivery_receipts): (abs((discrepancy - (received_quantity - allocated_quantity))) &amp;lt; 0.0005)&lt;br&gt;ck_rec_reason (delivery_receipts): ((abs(discrepancy) &amp;lt; 0.0005) or (char_length(trim(coalesce(discrepancy_reason,&amp;#x27;&amp;#x27;))) &amp;gt; 0))&lt;br&gt;ck_rec_disposition (delivery_receipts): (((abs(discrepancy) &amp;lt; 0.0005) and (shortfall_disposition = &amp;#x27;NONE&amp;#x27;)) or ((discrepancy &amp;lt; -(0.0005)) and (shortfall_disposition in (&amp;#x27;RETURNED_TO_FARM&amp;#x27;,&amp;#x27;LOST_IN_TRANSIT&amp;#x27;))))&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Triggers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;trg_movement_rules: BEFORE INSERT stock_movements: unit must match the lot; RESERVED/LOSS/CORRECTION_REMOVE &amp;lt;= available; DELIVERY/RESERVATION_RELEASED &amp;lt;= reserved&lt;br&gt;trg_lot_crop_matches_cycle: BEFORE INSERT harvest_lots: crop_id must equal its crop cycle&amp;#x27;s crop_id&lt;br&gt;trg_moves_no_update: BEFORE UPDATE stock_movements: blocked (append-only ledger)&lt;br&gt;trg_moves_no_delete: BEFORE DELETE stock_movements: blocked (append-only ledger)&lt;br&gt;trg_audit_no_update: BEFORE UPDATE audit_log: blocked (append-only)&lt;br&gt;trg_audit_no_delete: BEFORE DELETE audit_log: blocked (append-only)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#FAFAF7;strokeColor=#9CA3AF;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="2580" width="5500" height="803" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>